//// Decision 441 (144 B-00e; its cell waited on B-00k for decision 457's
//// per-target answer, 144 B-29 step H): a float's text at run time is
//// std-wasm's on wasm, which is erlang's and beam's — `5.0` in a template,
//// `1.0e21`, `1.0e-7` — and commonJS spells them the same (144 B-78).

pub fn main() {
    val five = 5.0;
    @print("${five}");
    @print(1.0e21);
    @print(1.0e-7);
}
